WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.327
JAMIE: Is that an infrastructure move,
or a hedge against the cloud providers

00:00:02.327 --> 00:00:04.654
JAMIE: they depend on?

00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:08.471
RUFUS: Both, I think. And that's rather
the point. Anthropic's S-1 disclosed a

00:00:08.471 --> 00:00:12.202
RUFUS: large monthly services contract
for computing through May twenty twenty-
nine. That's the

00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:15.934
RUFUS: existing dependency. The turbines
may be the beginning of an exit from

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:19.665
RUFUS: it.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.447
JAMIE: So they're buying their way
toward independence.
